+    /* The lizard-mode watchdog's keep-alive, fed on a thread of its own, on
+       a handle of its own, every STEAMDECK_LIZARD_WATCHDOG_MS: its three
+       feature reports are USB control transfers (about 8 ms in all on the
+       Deck), which must not stall the thread that pumps the joysticks, and
+       the controller's timeout is a time, not a count of updates. The
+       thread takes neither the joystick lock nor the device's dev_lock. */
+    SDL_hid_device *watchdog_dev;
